-/**
- * Produces the read model exposed to a viewer. Operators and CEOs receive the
- * complete authenticated operations view. Viewer output intentionally omits
- * policy/specification documents, delegation authority, approval scope hashes,
- * request bodies, and event payloads that can reveal internal control details.
